{"exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"layer":"bg","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5,"x":-500,"mirrow":false,"y":-125,"img":"bgblack","addImg":""},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":0.4,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"layer":"bg","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1.5,"x":-500,"mirrow":false,"y":-125,"img":"bgblack","addImg":""},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"x":370,"mirrow":false,"y":-52,"img":"chara027_1","addImg":"chara027_1_face_chara027_1c"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"x":370,"mirrow":false,"y":-52,"img":"chara027_1","addImg":"chara027_1_face_chara027_1c"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"梅莉莉","text":"[show]你是在好奇我这身侍者服吗？它可是我亲自设计的，既是我最骄傲的作品，也是我信仰侍者之道的证明。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara027_1_face_chara027_1a"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"梅莉莉","text":"[show]无论是上班工作、外出战斗，还是日常休息，我都会穿着这套衣服。[r]而且，侍者队的大家也都很喜欢它呢。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara027_1_face_chara027_1d"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"梅莉莉","text":"[show]请完全放心，我的侍者装永远保持洁净如新。[r]为了做到这一点，我每天回家后都会仔细清洗，并且衣柜里常备五套一模一样的备用装呢。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara027_1_face_chara027_1a"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"梅莉莉","text":"[show]哪怕在激烈的战斗中衣服被撕破，我也会在当晚连夜缝补好，确保第二天能精神抖擞地穿上它，继续在旅店里为大家提供贴心的服务。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara027_1_face_chara027_1b"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"梅莉莉","text":"[show]说起来，如果你有衣服需要修补的话，别客气，随时可以来找我帮忙哦。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"}],"des":"梅莉莉-友善1","script":"yd_027_01"}